OL,3,GNEWSAParents in plea to reverse        
OL,4,Aplayground decline                     
OL,6,FMeanwhile, one parent claimed the park 
OL,7,Fhis children use has not been upgraded 
OL,8,Fsince he was five, while another site  
OL,9,Fhas seen so much equipment scrapped it 
OL,10,Fnow has just one climbing frame.       
